  <description type="1" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Following three consecutive poor rainy seasons, the conflict in Northern Ethiopia, ethnic conflict and the displacement of more than 5 million people, up to 30 million people have humanitarian needs in Ethiopia. This allocation of 30 mio. DKK contributes to meeting the objectives of the draft 2022 Humanitarian Response Plan for Ethiopia.

Meeting the objectives of the draft 2022 Humanitarian Response Plan for Ethiopia.

Due to its nature as a response to a humanitarian appeal operational results are general and highly aggregated and the MFA contribution is thus reflected in the overall results reporting by the partner.  Please refer to the hyperlink below.

https://www.unocha.org/research-and-reports</narrative>
  </description>
